  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "心內話 - 阿母ê紅豆粽"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">阿母ê紅豆粽</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 珍--a</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjaQqAHwVeDi1JE3Z970Cvb2u7F1emlBitArZn5tzf2YI3LkgHOa754-yuJtYSLxMVB2Lc8QtG4-ZK919KOTSAu13K9yDmN44xytTAHTYFAVhGWrWki3cuSlGlync3IUh2m2gISLMxf2xCDkZsEMh_DSH6_pnEV344LZXou6y8OmZPR9SNMjJvVJO40h6x6\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        逐年ê五日節，我lóng ē想起阮阿母ê紅豆粽。紅豆粽是啥滋味--leh？He是chu̍t米黏黏加上紅豆甜甜，hō͘人食著心肝頭chiok幸福ê滋味。<br><br>阮兜是作田--ê，阮阿母勤儉koh骨力，所以過年過節阿母lóng家己做粿縛粽。伊ê手藝chiâⁿ好，做粿縛粽食--過ê人，逐家lóng呵咾。其中，紅豆粽是我細漢上愛食ê過節ê mi̍h件，逐年我lóng食chiok濟粒來慶祝五日節。<br><br>粽是用麻竹葉包--ê，記持中，我讀小學熱--人放學ê時，阿母叫我穿作穡ê長衫褲kā伊tàu-saⁿ-kāng，伊夯樓梯kah攑柴刀chhōa我去山頂，去有幾若欉麻竹hia。風吹ê時chūn，麻竹仔kho̍k-kho̍k-chhuah，阿母叫我kā伊hōaⁿ樓梯，伊peh起去頂koân挽葉仔。Hit-tang-chūn ê阿母káⁿ-ná像武俠片ê女俠仝款koân-koân tī麻竹頂，我chiok佩服阿母lóng m̄驚ē跋--落-來。我真頂真kā樓梯hōaⁿ--leh，阿母ná挽粽葉ná講：「今年麻竹葉真súi，包紅豆粽一定真好食。」<br><br>等阿母挽了，伊行落來塗跤，阮兩个母仔囝就tī塗跤khioh粽葉仔。Tī麻竹跤chiok涼--ê，iáu-m̄-koh蠓chiok厚，雖bóng有穿長衫長褲，我ê面soah hō͘蠓叮幾若phok，癢kah bē堪--得。收工了後，tńg到厝，阿母kā我抹藥仔，伊講佳哉有我tàu-saⁿ-kāng，粽葉仔chiah ē順利挽了，伊ē縛chiok濟紅豆粽hō͘我食，我拄leh心情chiâⁿ bái，聽著án-ne就笑--出-來--ah。<br><br>隔tńg工，阿母kā麻竹葉提去曝hō͘ ta，伊講曝hō͘ ta，chiah ē-sái囥久bē歹，等五日節chiah提出來縛粽。我心內想，五日節koh ài八個外月--leh，阿母chiâⁿ gâu做「好天tio̍h存雨來糧」ê拍算。<br><br>五日節tih-beh到--ah，阿母就kā麻竹粽葉提出來浸一點鐘，用大鼎hiâⁿ燒滾水，kā粽葉囥落去sa̍h-sa̍h--leh，sa̍h好囥hō͘冷，準備縛粽。Sòa--來kā浸--過ê chu̍t米kah紅豆lā-lā--leh，內底摻炒kah芳kòng-kòng ê餡，餡有阮囡仔上愛食ê瘦肉、蝦仁、鰇魚、香菇。<br><br>阿母ná唱歌ná縛粽，chiâⁿ歡喜，因為伊知影伊八个囡仔kah翁婿lóng chiok愛食伊縛ê紅豆粽，雖bóng真厚工，iáu-m̄-koh bē辛苦--lah。<br><br>我已經30幾年無法度食阮阿母親手縛ê紅豆粽--ah，真siàu念。Tī天頂ê阿母，你好--無？\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgoptY4vK03vRskmhcL5B9ePRAiAav6Zxrj668QV2EmxF6SQKrv-5F11C-a4UIqKeY8sfELSFVzucQaz1VI-d3B2ElYXTbWhuZqT9BTeL4GaHUjcqCho2r0AdSvrUROIJXwNFiVReFwzuYEJq5aQ9qUkze_8TI5hn_INomHCdAwPcVYYNYrE0nWBhbdVl41\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 387期，2026年06月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
